= We have stolen some tanks!

<div class="event-container">
  <img class="face-status" src="img/portraits/secret_police.jpg" alt="Dih rose">
  <p>
  Director [+ director_s +] has created a mastermind of a plan, by using our top spy and turning him into a lonesome farmer who served in the great war, we can get rid of suspicion that he is correlated with us. Than after we steal the prototype of these "tanks" and plant it into a farmers auction. We then buy it off the auction, and when time came to repair it, we can sue the government for the designs of the tanks for right to repair!
  </p>
</div>

